+        // Trusted-adapter metadata fault ONLY: re-observe the SAME <=F capsule
+        // without any media submission. Family/F scalar fields remain equal,
+        // but the real production native domain's potential-IO serial changes.
+        // This isolates the N2 witness predicate missing from Root v7.
